request.description:
The entity-search call the backend adapter makes (`Client.Search` → `doSearch`).

Response shape:
```json
{
  "searchinfo": { "search": "Kansas City Chiefs" },
  "search": [
    {
      "id": "Q223522",
      "title": "Q223522",
      "label": "Kansas City Chiefs",
      "description": "National Football League franchise in Kansas City, Missouri",
      "match": { "type": "label", "language": "en", "text": "Kansas City Chiefs" }
    }
  ],
  "success": 1
}
```

The adapter maps each element `search[].{id,label,description}` → `{qid,label,description,entityType:"item"}` (domain `WikidataSearchResult`).

